<view class="page"><view class="content personalize"><view class="title">让湾月更了解你</view><view class="subtitle intro">不填写也可以直接看今日运势。</view><view class="field"><text class="label">昵称（选填）</text><input class="input-box" maxlength="20" placeholder="如何称呼你" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="nickname" /></view><view class="field"><text class="label">生日（选填）</text><picker mode="date" value="{{birthday}}" bindchange="birthday"><view class="input-box date-input {{birthday ? '' : 'muted'}}">{{birthday || '选择日期'}}</view></picker></view><view class="footnote note">仅保存于本机；演示结果不会依据资料改变。</view><button class="primary-button save" bindtap="save">保存设置</button><button class="skip" bindtap="skip">跳过，直接查看</button></view></view>
